---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Berlin Beat.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium sm:text-3xl">Contact</h1>
    <div class="prose mt-4 max-w-none">
      <p>
        If you are or represent a musician either from Berlin or scheduled to play in Berlin,
        please contact us for press coverage. We are interested in interviewing anyone associated
        with the local music scene, from musicians to bookers to venue owners to record stores to
        promotors. In addition, we occasionally review albums and shows, and often take live
        photos. We can't promise we will respond to every inquiry, but we certainly will try.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please note that if your band is not based in Berlin and/or will not be touring in
        Berlin, we do not provide coverage, as there must somehow be a link to the city.
        Additionally, if you are going on tour and want help finding dates in Berlin, please DO
        NOT contact us. This is something we do not do; we are writers, not bookers, or
        promoters. If you are really stuck, <a href="http://lmgtfy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">try this</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        For inquiries, suggestions, comments, or to write for us, <a href="mailto:berlinerbeat@gmail.com">email Berlin Beat</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Berlin Beat is fueled solely by a love of music combined with a penchant for proper
        journalism.
      </p>
      <p>
        All content of this website—written, visual or otherwise—with the exception of that
        noted, belongs to Berlin Beat and its contributors, &copy; 2011-2026 &ndash; all rights
        reserved. Any unauthorized copying of text or photos, in part or in full, will constitute
        an infringement of copyright.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
